NOTICE — BRISQUE model redistribution (model/other_models/brisque_live.model)
============================================================================

This directory ships `brisque_live.model`, the trained libsvm EPSILON_SVR model
used by the fork's BRISQUE no-reference image-quality extractor
(core/src/feature/brisque.c, feature name "brisque"). The model and its
companion feature range-normalization arrays originate from the LIVE laboratory
at The University of Texas at Austin and the BRISQUE authors' reference
implementations. The fork uses and redistributes the model under the BRISQUE
release notice of The University of Texas at Austin, reproduced verbatim in
LICENSES/LicenseRef-LIVE-BRISQUE.txt (docs/adr/1507-brisque-live-notice-terms.md).

